      "text": "**Calculating a math problem**\n\nI’m looking at the expression 33 + 14 - 2*4. First, I’ll do the multiplication: 2*4 equals 8. Okay, now I have 33 + 14 - 8. I think I should add first: 33 + 14 gives me 47. Then subtracting 8 leaves me with 39. So the result is 39. Oddly enough, that makes me think of Lima, but I’m not quite sure why! It’s an interesting connection, though."
    }
